```

MfPlugin parses those file blocks and writes the returned content to disk.

Before writing files, it stores the previous file contents in `.mfhist`, making
the last save-output operation revertible with `<Leader>4`.

## History and revert

MfPlugin stores project-local history in:

```text
.mfhist
```

The file keeps:

- the previous user prompt
- backup data for the last saved output operation

Press `<Leader>4` inside the main popup to revert the last saved output
operation.

